# 土区20X
#在 one.google.com/ai 页面把 AI Ultra 新套餐 ID 换回旧 SKU：5X 20tb.m.v2→20tb.m，20X 30tb.ai.pro.m→30tb.m

[Body Rewrite]

http-response ^https://one[.]google[.]com/ai[?].*$ 30tb[.]ai[.]pro[.]m 30tb.m
http-response ^https://one[.]google[.]com/ai[?].*$ 20tb[.]m[.]v2 20tb.m

[MITM]
hostname = %APPEND% one.google.com
